  "description": "Split into two teams, one lined up at the top face-off circle and one at the bottom, each with a pylon beside them. All the pucks (the gold) sit in the middle at the blue line. One skater from each team at a time skates around their pylon, grabs one puck and carries it to their team's corner. When the gold is gone, the team with more pucks in its corner wins.",
